<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    「飞升之悦」心情（2026-10-25 用户：每完成一个飞升 +15 心情，描述就是群星那四句）。

    One situational thought per ascension, +15 mood each, so a fully ascended colony sits at +60.
    ThoughtWorker_AscensionJoy activates only the defs whose ascension is actually researched, so the
    mood panel lists exactly the lines of the finished ascensions. Description = that ascension's
    Stellaris flavour line (the same one shown on the research node). English text lives in
    Languages/English/DefInjected/ThoughtDef/ResearchLoopsThoughts.xml (stages.0.label / .description).
  -->

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>RL_AscensionJoy_Mind</defName>
    <workerClass>LocalMods.ResearchLoops.ThoughtWorker_AscensionJoy</workerClass>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>飞升之悦 · 心胜于物</label>
        <description>意识是最后一片未被测绘的疆域，这个物种与生俱来的灵能天赋，此前只在少数个体身上露出过一角。当灵能不再向施法者索取代价，天赋便成了本能。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>15</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>RL_AscensionJoy_Mech</defName>
    <workerClass>LocalMods.ResearchLoops.ThoughtWorker_AscensionJoy</workerClass>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>飞升之悦 · 合成进化</label>
        <description>有机心智被囚禁在会疲惫、会疼痛、会衰老的躯壳里，这本身就是一种低效。把神经模式迁入合成之躯。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>15</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>RL_AscensionJoy_Body</defName>
    <workerClass>LocalMods.ResearchLoops.ThoughtWorker_AscensionJoy</workerClass>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>飞升之悦 · 血肉苦弱</label>
        <description>疼痛、失血、倦意、饥馁与无聊——没有一条是进化给的礼物，全是脆弱有机体的妥协。将躯体逐步替换为义体。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>15</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>RL_AscensionJoy_Gene</defName>
    <workerClass>LocalMods.ResearchLoops.ThoughtWorker_AscensionJoy</workerClass>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>飞升之悦 · 设计进化</label>
        <description>把物种的未来交给随机突变，是低效到令人煎熬的过程。亲自重写基因蓝图。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>15</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
